Day 11 Notes – Add & Remove Elements

Select input and button
const input = document.querySelector("#skillInput");
const btn = document.querySelector("#addSkillBtn");
const list = document.querySelector("#skillList");
Add new item on click
btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
const value = input.value.trim();
if (value === "") return;

const li = document.createElement("li");
li.textContent = value;
list.appendChild(li);
input.value = "";
});

Create Delete button
const deleteBtn = document.createElement("button");
deleteBtn.textContent = "Delete";
Remove element
deleteBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
li.remove();
});
